	(text "Power nets +5V, 3V3, +3V7, -3V7, 5V_A are carried as hierarchical sheet pins (joined on this sheet by local labels). GND is a global net: each sub-\nsheet carries a global label GND (no sheet pin)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d642488-7ef7-4a8a-a328-e4dd170a0efc")
	)
	(text "Root sheet. Signal flow: Power → Front End → Slicer/LVDS → Connector; Detector and Control close the AGC/threshold loop; MCU hooks optional. Status\nlabels: VERIFIED / PROPOSED / UNRESOLVED. No part values are approved for fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "60063601-d035-44f5-a114-24dc77fe37cb")
	)
	(text "Global net GND enters here only to carry a PWR_FLAG for ERC. HV_MON is Power -> Connector and MCU; DAC_HV is MCU -> Power; HOLD_N is Connector -> Control.\nThe Control hierarchical pin LOS is the active-low net LOS_N on the Control sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 262 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f218e266-4e3f-43f2-a104-b726197661db")
	)
	(text "Global net GND enters here only to carry a PWR_FLAG for ERC. HV_MON is Power -> Connector and MCU; DAC_HV is MCU -> Power; HOLD_N is Connector -> Control.\nThe Control hierarchical pin LOS is the active-low net LOS_N on the Control sheet."
